# Profile organisation-0.3 (LABS-1.049, DI-13, MP-1): a co-signed act names several officials in one account. Widens
# a cardinality only (no type, role, plays or owns is added): needs core-0.4-event-multiplicity, which opens
# event:actor. The office and its context stay single. Whether several officials are co-signatories or conflicting
# evidence is judged by the event-role constraints (MP-2, MP-4): `one` unless the act is established as
# organisation:co-signed.
define
relation official-act relates official @card(0..);
